TANE OS / RUST BARE METAL
Self-made BIOS loader + Rust kernel. External crates: 0.
64-bit mode | VGA + COM1 | PS/2 keyboard | bounded user heap
RAM: 7 E820 entries | 16058 free 4 KiB frames (64232 KiB) above 1 MiB
IDT: 32 exception handlers, #DF on IST1 | PIT timer 100 Hz
Tasks: preemptive round robin, up to 8 tasks
Protection: NX data | kernel text read-only | null page unmapped | CR0.WP
MAC: enforcing compiled-in policy | shell domain admin (drop lowers it)
Disk: none (attach an IDE disk for TaneFS)
Network: RTL8139 MAC 52:54:00:12:34:56 | static IPv4 + IPv6
Type help. English keyboard / ASCII input.
READY
tane> ping 10.0.2.2 --count 2 --timeout 500
reply from 10.0.2.2: seq=1 bytes=16 ttl=255 time=0 ms
reply from 10.0.2.2: seq=2 bytes=16 ttl=255 time=0 ms
2 sent, 2 received
tane> ping fd00::2 --count 2 --timeout 500
reply from fd00::2: seq=1 bytes=16 ttl=255 time=0 ms
reply from fd00::2: seq=2 bytes=16 ttl=255 time=0 ms
2 sent, 2 received
